ollowing modules in Python-Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-Learn, matplotlib, Imbalanced-learn Logistic Regression gave AUC=0.95, but the precision was very low (0.08). So, I tried Random Forests and it gave AUC=0.94 and precision=0.85 (with 'gini' criterion) and AUC=0.92 & precision=0.83 (with 'entropy' criterion). Measured performance metrics-accuracy, precision, recall, AUC and plotted ROC curve Used the following modules in Python-Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-Learn, matplotlib, Imbalanced-learn","topics":[],"score":216971,"global_rank":233943,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":38590},{"name":"benblank/git-alias","owner":"benblank","html_url":"https://github.com/benblank/git-alias","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Git subcommands for managing aliases.","topics":[],"score":216970,"global_rank":233948,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":38591},{"name":"william-galvin/wikispeedia-bot","owner":"william-galvin","html_url":"https://github.com/william-galvin/wikispeedia-bot","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A Twitter bot that plays Wikispeedia","topics":[],"score":216970,"global_rank":233950,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":38592},{"name":"matsengrp/bioboxmixcr","owner":"matsengrp","html_url":"https://github.com/matsengrp/bioboxmixcr","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A biobox (http://bioboxes.org/) for Mixcr (https://github.com/milaboratory/mixcr)","topics":[],"score":216967,"global_rank":233957,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":38593},{"name":"jacksonwelsh/raspi-wifilights","owner":"jacksonwelsh","html_url":"https://github.com/jacksonwelsh/raspi-wifilights","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":216967,"global_rank":233960,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":38594},{"name":"davisagli/Products.RelationIndex","owner":"davisagli",